<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/values22-2.6> a ipbes:SubChapter ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/values22ch2> ;
    ipbes:Reference <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/GFZT3YW6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/SWACLFVP>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/T23WTMMD> ;
    ipbes:Report <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/values22> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription """
Based on three stages of literature review and ILK dialogues and submissions, Chapter 2 authors characterized and assessed different conceptualizations of nature, nature’s contributions to people and human-nature relationships and how these diverse ways of understanding affect peoples’ attitudes, behaviour and decisions. This process brought to light knowledge and capacity gaps (Box 2.15, see Chapter 6). To conclude, the chapter’s findings are brought into perspective as insights to the IPBES conceptual framework (IPBES 2/4) (see 2.6.1), to the science-policy interface (see 2.6.2) and to this assessment’s subsequent chapters (see 2.6.3).
2.6.1. Relevance for the IPBES conceptual framework
Chapter 2’s main concepts and their interrelations are visualized in Figure 2.24; red numbers refer to pathways that complement and enhance the IPBES conceptual framework ITEM CSL_CITATION {"citationID":"gYFo6hnQ","properties":{"formattedCitation":"(D\\\\uc0\\\\u237{}az et\\\\uc0\\\\u160{}al., 2015; IPBES-2/4, s.\\\\uc0\\\\u160{}f.)","plainCitation":"(Díaz, 2015; IPBES-2/4, s. f.)","dontUpdate":true,"noteIndex":0},"citationItems":[{"id":113705,"uris":["http://zotero.org/groups/2345372/items/T23WTMMD"],"itemData":{"id":113705,"type":"article-journal","container-title":"Current Opinion in Environmental Sustainability","DOI":"10.1016/j.cosust.2014.11.002","ISSN":"18773435","journalAbbreviation":"Current Opinion in Environmental Sustainability","language":"English","page":"1-16","source":"DOI.org (Crossref)","title":"The IPBES Conceptual Framework — connecting nature and people","volume":"14","author":[{"family":"Díaz","given":"S."},{"family":"Demissew","given":"S."},{"family":"Carabias","given":"J."},{"family":"Joly","given":"C."},{"family":"Lonsdale","given":"M."},{"family":"Ash","given":"N."},{"family":"Larigauderie","given":"A."},{"family":"Adhikari","given":"J. R."},{"family":"Arico","given":"S."},{"family":"Báldi","given":"A."},{"family":"Bartuska","given":"A."},{"family":"Baste","given":"I. A."},{"family":"Bilgin","given":"A."},{"family":"Brondizio","given":"E."},{"family":"Chan","given":"K. M."},{"family":"Figueroa","given":"V. E."},{"family":"Duraiappah","given":"A."},{"family":"Fischer","given":"M."},{"family":"Hill","given":"R."},{"family":"Koetz","given":"T."},{"family":"Leadley","given":"P."},{"family":"Lyver","given":"P."},{"family":"Mace","given":"G. M."},{"family":"Martin-Lopez","given":"B."},{"family":"Okumura","given":"M."},{"family":"Pacheco","given":"D."},{"family":"Pascual","given":"U."},{"family":"Pérez","given":"E. S."},{"family":"Reyers","given":"B."},{"family":"Roth","given":"E."},{"family":"Saito","given":"O."},{"family":"Scholes","given":"R. J